I hear Nina travelled
around Europe for a while


01:20:36.722 --> 01:20:39.962
and eventually got a job
at a fancy restaurant in Rome.


01:20:40.121 --> 01:20:44.082
This year, her parents are going to
visit her for Thanksgiving.


01:20:50.200 --> 01:20:51.848
I'm not saying
what happened last Christmas


01:20:52.000 --> 01:20:54.084
happened solely
because of Nina.


01:20:55.440 --> 01:20:58.888
I'm saying maybe what happened
needed to happen,


01:20:59.040 --> 01:21:01.364
even for me.


01:21:03.920 --> 01:21:05.644
- Ah!
- Whoa! Whoa!


01:21:05.800 --> 01:21:07.687
My dad came into the city
the other day


01:21:07.840 --> 01:21:09.640
to celebrate my new job.


01:21:10.799 --> 01:21:13.320
He told me he offered the house
to my mom but...


01:21:13.480 --> 01:21:14.963
...she didn't want it.


01:21:15.120 --> 01:21:18.840
He thought about selling
but decided to hold onto it


01:21:18.999 --> 01:21:20.482
for when Toby and I
come visit.


01:21:20.639 --> 01:21:23.279
He's still
figuring things out.


01:21:23.439 --> 01:21:26.886
But, luckily, he has
his best friend to help with that.


01:22:47.354 --> 01:22:50.801
# I saw you, I found you


01:22:50.954 --> 01:22:54.281
# I watched you grow


01:22:54.433 --> 01:22:57.281
# Slowly but surely


01:22:57.434 --> 01:23:01.514
# We ebb and we ﬂow


01:23:01.673 --> 01:23:05.001
# I felt a change


01:23:05.152 --> 01:23:08.557
# Deep in my bones


01:23:08.712 --> 01:23:13.437
# Something new


01:23:13.592 --> 01:23:15.633
# Has grown


01:23:21.232 --> 01:23:24.559
# I was inside waiting


01:23:24.712 --> 01:23:28.159
# Eyes open wide


01:23:28.311 --> 01:23:33.996
# I felt the ground beneath me wake


01:23:35.431 --> 01:23:38.836
# I felt a change


01:23:38.991 --> 01:23:42.439
# Deep in my bones


01:23:42.590 --> 01:23:48.155
# Something new


01:23:48.311 --> 01:23:50.394
# Has grown


01:24:03.829 --> 01:24:06.349
# Up in your room


01:24:06.509 --> 01:24:10.874
# Was a great silent storm


01:24:11.029 --> 01:24:12.273
# Clouds have cleared


01:24:12.429 --> 01:24:16.913
# The air was sweet and warm. #

